ning_skills", "contents": [{"type": "skill", "content": "Writing"}, {"type": "skill", "content": "Speaking"}, {"type": "skill", "content": "Reading"}, {"type": "skill", "content": "Listening"}]}, {"type": "post_instructions", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "\nInstructions: Complete the following steps. Fill in the Self Assessment.\n"}]}]}], "type": "scholar", "stimuli": [{"type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "template_override": 1, "id": 0, "_data": []}, {"contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"coverimg": "engenn9le16ob09re2img05.jpg", "audiosrc": "engenn9le16ob09re2aud01", "images": [{"time": "0", "image": "engenn9le16ob09re2img05.jpg", "text": "", "id": 0}, {"time": "100", "image": "engenn9le16ob09re2img05.jpg", "text": "<span class= \"strong\"> Bianca</span>: Sorry, I was super busy the other day. I could have come over after nine, but I thought it was too late. I should have called earlier in the day.<br />\n<span class= \"strong\"> Kristi</span>: It's ok.<br />\n<span class= \"strong\"> Bianca</span>: So how did the interview go?<br />\n<span class= \"strong\"> Kristi</span>: It went really well. I think I hit it out of the park!<br />\n<span class= \"strong\"> Bianca</span>: Fantastic! You didn't get nervous?<br />\n<span class= \"strong\"> Kristi</span>:  Nope. I was well prepared and was able to answer all his questions clearly and concisely and I had a secret weapon.<br />\n<span class= \"strong\"> Bianca</span>: What was that?<br />\n<span class= \"strong\"> Kristi</span>: Well, I got there early and I sat right next to the interview room door ... and I could hear everything.<br />\n<span class= \"strong\"> Bianca</span>: Wow!<br />", "id": 1}, {"time": "54000", "image": "engenn9le16ob09re2img07.jpg", "text": "<span class= \"strong\"> Kristi:</span> I listened to another candidate being interviewed.<br />\n<span class= \"strong\"> Bianca</span>: Did it help?<br />\n<span class= \"strong\"> Kristi</span>: It helped me so much! I sat there and critiqued that person's interview. I  thought she should have said this and  she could have answered that.<br />\n<span class= \"strong\"> Bianca</span>: Oh yeah? Give me an example.<br />\n<span class= \"strong\"> Kristi</span>: Well, this woman responded to a basic polite greeting in an extremely informal manner.<br />\nShe should have been much more formal and she shouldn't have talked so much.<br />\n<span class= \"strong\"> Bianca</span>: What did she say?<br />\n<span class= \"strong\"> Kristi</span>: She answered a simple how are you question with her life story. She could have just responded with, \u201cFine thank you.\u201d or she could have asked the interviewer how he was.  I think it turned the interviewer off right out of the gate.<br />", "id": 2}, {"time": "104000", "image": "engenn9le16ob09re2img06.jpg", "text": "<span class= \"strong\"> Bianca</span>: Well, that should have made you feel quite confident.<br />\n<span class= \"strong\"> Kristi</span>: Extremely!<br />\n<span class= \"strong\"> Bianca</span>: So what's the next step in the interview process?<br />\n<span class= \"strong\"> Kristi</span>: Well, they will contact me before 3:00 p.m. Friday.<br />\n<span class= \"strong\"> Bianca</span>: Are you going to send a thank you e-mail?<br />\n<span class= \"strong\"> Kristi</span>: I will do that after we leave. I'm also madly researching BFP for any other information on the web. Based on my interview, I think I'm going to get this job!<br />", "id": 3}]}}], "template_override": 1, "title": "", "type": "audio", "id": 1, "_data": []}], "id": 0, "_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"type": "has_nav", "content": true}, {"type": "has_exercise_controls", "content": true}]}]}]}